{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0187_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_01_title", "source_sha256": "801ab38da5f106e48b54f9c3c65e239c275e5f283a153484440b88e546e9cefe", "ja": "過激に……意外に？", "zh": "过激地……出人意料地？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0187_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "3e33ceb823e77a7cb594e2e72fac1f22b97e6e352a0933a39895da0db22a5bea", "ja": "天体公演で新曲を披露する事になった、\n琴葉、海美、亜利沙、志保。\nメンバーの選定理由を、自分たちへの挑戦と\n受け止めたアイドル達は、プロデューサーを\n見返すため、やる気を見せるのだった。", "zh": "确定要在天体公演中表演新曲的，\n是琴叶、海美、亚利沙和志保。\n将入选理由视为向自己发起的挑战，\n偶像们为了让制作人刮目相看，\n展现出了十足的干劲。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0187_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_01_1000_029umi", "source_sha256": "282276df6c33e8b348649cfc1f95fc6f2435c5dd89fadc17693cf4bf3408c16a", "ja": "次って天体公演だよね？　ってことは、私たちで\nユニットを組むのかな？　ありりんはどう思う？", "zh": "下一场是天体公演对吧？　也就是说，要由我们\n组建一个组合吗？　亚利莎，你觉得呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0187_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_01_1001_028ari", "source_sha256": "eb0cea987c7a141ecc684f6582722ed3b33810fd4fb4b39010c7eaaa9c3f3d94", "ja": "高確率で海美ちゃんに同意です。今日のメンバーは、\nみんな天体公演でユニットを組んでいませんし！", "zh": "我很可能会同意海美的看法。今天的成员，大家都没有在天体公演里组过队呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0187_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_01_1002_028ari", "source_sha256": "04436ff09d59b71ff6db0417ab99c6b71293de4648240addf53e727ab6034c4b", "ja": "元気系の海美ちゃん、クールな志保ちゃん、\nそして清純派の琴葉ちゃん……！", "zh": "活力十足的海美、冷酷的志保，还有清纯派的琴叶……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0187_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_01_1003_028ari", "source_sha256": "a0117b7300b5e367053aaf27d05ae758e2d5d6699ef1afe9960917276a9a45ee", "ja": "いったい、どんな曲なんでしょう！\nありさ、今から楽しみですーっ！　……ムフフ♪", "zh": "究竟会是怎样的一首歌呢！\n亚利沙现在就已经超级期待了——！……嘿嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0187_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_01_1004_029umi", "source_sha256": "7d8c5e7f7523d33fc59bba0e70b13ea1c15a9e1c9744ac52757d445e5a22c284", "ja": "何言ってるの、ありりん！　ありりんは、えっと……\n元気をあげる系アイドル！でしょ！？", "zh": "你在说什么呀，亚里凛！亚里凛是，那个……\n属于给人带来活力的偶像！对吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0187_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_01_1005_033sih", "source_sha256": "31648d7343c4c7c0c57796731816c7880ccb0872870b23554070153db2e33bb6", "ja": "新ユニット、なんだかにぎやかになりそうですね。\n……それにしても、琴葉さん遅いな。", "zh": "新组合感觉会变得热闹起来呢。\n……话说回来，琴叶怎么还没来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0187_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_01_1006_p", "source_sha256": "e9f901838145e7d844132e642ff19ccd9b820a071e2dae764fe1834e82e29c52", "ja": "（今日はこれから、天体公演の打ち合わせだ。\nみんな、もう集まってるかな？）", "zh": "（今天接下来要开天体公演的筹备会。\n大家已经集合了吗？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0187_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_01_1007_017kth", "source_sha256": "c162991f2e63aea88fadba66b2864803b35d9ab22c7f357693fbff6a21d2dddd", "ja": "お疲れさまです、{$P$}！\nよかった、なんとか間に合って……。", "zh": "辛苦了，{$P$}！\n太好了，总算及时赶上了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0187_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_01_1008_p", "source_sha256": "2da170e7f3b044a9182097f7b7dbbc8783e68032a5e10508612c423f73fbfd93", "ja": "お疲れさま、琴葉。\n琴葉が時間ギリギリなんて珍しいな。", "zh": "辛苦了，琴叶。\n你差点迟到还真是少见。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0187_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_01_1009_017kth", "source_sha256": "9aa14faef70f066c744c06aff350833f8b334fbb09d643ae934d5443c7f27796", "ja": "はい。30分前には着く予定だったんですけど、\n日直の仕事が長引いてしまって。", "zh": "是的，本来预计能在提前30分钟的时候赶到，可是值日的工作拖得有点久。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0187_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_01_1010_p", "source_sha256": "05fc3fdd33f90c963881200ee0deaf02e7204dd286949e3a45b1a1f8632a5189", "ja": "そうだったのか。\nみんなもう揃ってるだろうし、行こうか！", "zh": "原来是这样。\n大家应该都已经到齐了，我们走吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0187_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_01_1011_017kth", "source_sha256": "c8437da922b05a66a006272ae646cc70f57e96453c9e5b620e3abbd8e90368f7", "ja": "はい！", "zh": "好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0187_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_01_1012_se", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0187_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_01_1013_p", "source_sha256": "cf6d8bc6b02595455c687088715c889bacaa76ad652d80244b5358954d3e7404", "ja": "みんな、お疲れ様！", "zh": "大家辛苦了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0187_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_01_1014_029umi", "source_sha256": "f569ed9a244cd2e12714daeb53671158adb628e7180044c1af0188e82cb29c5d", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}！\n琴葉も、お疲れさま♪", "zh": "啊，{$P$}！\n琴叶也辛苦啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0187_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_01_1015_028ari", "source_sha256": "b6f4b1216555f300c2ea6f23bfe9229c4f5c832846b6865816ab9821cd23b5ad", "ja": "お疲れさまです！", "zh": "辛苦你了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0187_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_01_1016_033sih", "source_sha256": "99738abdb75742333660bfe7541e6c845cc1b4ca109f0e6b475b4fad5b1934f8", "ja": "お疲れさまです。", "zh": "辛苦你了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0187_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_01_1017_p", "source_sha256": "5c77d3b48680acbc4c09b0c02c8bd5d6f2a2ebe6f6d5925c3bd076e93c7bac1a", "ja": "全員そろったところで、早速だけど\n打ち合わせを始めよう！", "zh": "既然大家都到齐了，那我们马上开始开会吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0187_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_01_1018_p", "source_sha256": "2de0c9ac06b33b4fa870af6bd2604d70f4b6b4d5807ded875203c06566316a3b", "ja": "次の公演は、この4人のユニットの新曲を披露するぞ！\n曲と歌詞ができたから、聞いてみてくれ。", "zh": "下一场公演要披露的是这支由4人组成的组合的新歌！\n歌曲和歌词都已经完成了，大家听听看吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0187_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_01_1020_029umi", "source_sha256": "a2d440c0ca5418d5735c99457c2e8899225aacac16b43cd39d8e081be0735be3", "ja": "おお……なんか、カッコいい曲だね～！？", "zh": "哦……总觉得是首很帅气的歌呢～！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0187_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_01_1021_028ari", "source_sha256": "fd6f103f266b7b23ec28aa8b74264d1b6cd34d151ebc82c6531f2459723c63b7", "ja": "はい！　実に、アダルティでセクシーな楽曲……\nこれは、曲に負けない表現力が求められるのでは！？", "zh": "是的！这首歌真是成熟又性感……\n看来需要展现出不输给歌曲的表现力才行吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0187_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_01_1022_017kth", "source_sha256": "41693b2e47605b4aed052e271686d47a299333b7fbc14b8250e90d92e7ff91fd", "ja": "歌詞も、ちょっと過激かも……。あの、\n{$P$}。本当に私たちでこの曲を？", "zh": "歌词也可能有点大胆……那个，{$P$}。真的要由我们来唱这首歌吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0187_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_01_1023_p", "source_sha256": "42c4a9663e280c762b97cafcbec7f9f2758fd0e4ec3e742e66a299171c4011bf", "ja": "ああ。今回はこの曲で、みんなの意外性……\nつまり、ギャップを見せようと思っているんだ。", "zh": "啊。这次我打算用这首歌，展现大家意想不到的一面……也就是所谓的反差。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0187_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_01_1024_028ari", "source_sha256": "ac0157e5e6f4458b3f0d29ef13e0005fabcd8b4458dcde50fefa989f1cd041a6", "ja": "意外性、なるほどなるほど……その戦略、\nアリですよ{$P$}さん！", "zh": "反差，原来如此原来如此……这个策略，\n很可以哦，{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0187_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_01_1025_028ari", "source_sha256": "56b31215e708a92016e71cdfdc0c1edfe32489c4b56cc2e303b85278b7590957", "ja": "撮影はぜひ、ありさにおまかせくださいっ！　みんなの\nセクシーショット、全力で撮影しますよ～！　ムフフ♪", "zh": "拍摄就请尽管交给亚利沙吧！大家的性感照片，亚利沙会全力拍摄的哦～！嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0187_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_01_1026_p", "source_sha256": "cc8d81a83ad4fd8d534e8e4698df396316a28b0c686611c128da75c9273e31b0", "ja": "いや、亜利沙も撮られる側だからな？\n撮影するより、される側で頑張ってほしい！", "zh": "不，亚利沙也是被拍的那一方吧？\n比起去拍照，我更希望你在被拍的那一方努力！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0187_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_01_1027_033sih", "source_sha256": "e9a66ce930cbd000157b617ba466aa4212299cf613f2458fa8e7ca83911c9a01", "ja": "あの、{$P$}さん。\nちょっといいですか？", "zh": "那个，{$P$}先生，\n可以打扰一下吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0187_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_01_1028_033sih", "source_sha256": "54ec1a6cdb0cc400be949ab49c4b9febc72d8b909648d8672b5ea8f248cecd6f", "ja": "この曲でギャップを見せるということは、つまり……\n普段の私たちは、セクシーじゃないってことですよね？", "zh": "用这首歌展现反差，也就是说……\n平时的我们并不性感，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0187_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_01_1029_p", "source_sha256": "58b0e970a7154805b730c7b8b8c1de11e8ba344e7e958f428d8b770162b6c66a", "ja": "えっ？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0187_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_01_1030_033sih", "source_sha256": "431db9d38e17d13be33954e378916739d8f5d54b7ae81b16ef31e5e1c636d6db", "ja": "私は中学生ですから、わかります。でも他のみんなは\n高校生ですし、セクシーなところもあると思うので……", "zh": "因为我是初中生，所以我明白。不过其他人都是高中生，应该也有性感的一面，所以……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0187_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_01_1031_033sih", "source_sha256": "e81e06ec5bdc7f42d4c6d646dabddf946e807cb8d95eb6aa1a935cd4a328cb27", "ja": "意外性っていうのは、失礼な気がするんですけど。", "zh": "我觉得说“出人意料”好像有点失礼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0187_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_01_1032_028ari", "source_sha256": "100d6104ce5de8360f05ac8c498ccdd4cf85a9e4f2e02c3a48713ead1f1063b4", "ja": "そんなことありませんよ、志保ちゃん！\nありさは志保ちゃんも、十分セクシーだと思います！", "zh": "才不是那回事呢，志保！\n阿利沙觉得，志保也已经足够性感了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0187_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_01_1033_033sih", "source_sha256": "f20ccffdedb86d863a563428d75cd4ae91d2683fcfa307db2945f78f6e074328", "ja": "いえ、そういう話をしているんじゃなくて……。", "zh": "不是，我说的不是这个意思……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0187_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_01_1034_p", "source_sha256": "9a9f337958cf199c1d64006fe398cac3a4500c6f68b39123ee823be872397725", "ja": "ま、まあまあ、ふたりとも。意外性っていうのは\nそういう意味じゃなくて、ええと……。", "zh": "好、好了，你们两个。所谓的出人意料不是那个意思，呃……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0187_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_01_1035_029umi", "source_sha256": "c868b71c7cf5dd9c9358950e172c3493af30cd873ff3956948967f673012b498", "ja": "でも、しほりんの言うとおりかも……だって\n{$P$}は、意外だって思うんでしょ？", "zh": "不过，志保说得也许没错……因为你觉得{$P$}很意外，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0187_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_01_1036_029umi", "source_sha256": "72f82bb115c3db0eb5318d92a64ed31a708ac8c40d1c7a6fe760e58f179e3753", "ja": "私、最近ちょっとは女子力上がってきたかなって\n思ってたのに……うう～っ、なんか悔しいー！！", "zh": "我最近还以为自己的女生魅力有所提升呢……呜呜～，好不甘心——！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0187_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_01_1037_017kth", "source_sha256": "253247adbb23f1071edac4bc8e37aff3bb4d657fd48581b6d18785511e65cff8", "ja": "海美ちゃん……。", "zh": "海美……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0187_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_01_1038_029umi", "source_sha256": "3a80402011fcd4bf7340224e13af6a8b287c1cd2c76f91bfbd3b57dcb32247bd", "ja": "それにそれに！　『灼熱少女』で活動してた時、\nけっこう「新境地開拓！」とか言われてたじゃない？", "zh": "而且而且！我们以『灼热少女』活动的时候，不是还经常被人说“开拓了新境界”之类的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0187_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_01_1039_029umi", "source_sha256": "a222c10fc3c9f961fa356ac656d5c75c4cf3fed4ba177a501f872fad9e453c89", "ja": "それなのに、色っぽくないって思われてるのって、\nなんか悔しいもんっ！　琴葉は、悔しくないの？", "zh": "明明是这样，却被认为不够有女人味，总觉得很不甘心！琴叶，你不觉得不甘心吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0187_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_01_1040_017kth", "source_sha256": "802a04b77ad6d5342fc88f58064c5beee70c8bd421709c77ae53d362fe491ecf", "ja": "え？　そ、そう言われると、たしかに……\n成長してないって言われてるみたいで悔しいかも……？", "zh": "诶？这么、这么一说，确实……\n感觉像是被说成毫无成长一样，或许还真有点不甘心……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0187_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_01_1041_028ari", "source_sha256": "0e39c99b79024f54b2a1d6944f645e3617b88e88cbe407eea0493106960390b7", "ja": "それに関しては、ありさが断言しますっ！\n『灼熱少女』のふたりは、実に！　セクシーだったと！", "zh": "关于这一点，就由亚利沙来断言吧！\n『灼热少女』的两位，真的！非常性感！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0187_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_01_1042_028ari", "source_sha256": "44345d8f903fcdf5ad5837115c14fb97c80d7a2a63be8cb9091db68397cdfbcd", "ja": "海美ちゃん、琴葉ちゃん、そして志保ちゃん！　みんな\nのセクシーさは、ありさが証明してみせますよぉ～っ！", "zh": "海美、琴叶，还有志保！大家的性感，就由亜利沙来证明给你们看吧～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0187_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_01_1043_p", "source_sha256": "3c800a0370f935d76e560fa71b0310d7a967ba76c48b98129f8cc746ea11e929", "ja": "いや、亜利沙だけ何だか方向性が違うような……。", "zh": "不，总觉得只有亚利沙的方向有点不一样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0187_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_01_1044_029umi", "source_sha256": "1b33a1de8f5a63153aa379c255b8518740a74178538aa033a13a38ed88e316e0", "ja": "よしっ！　こうなったら、{$P$}が\n「参った」っていうくらいセクシーな公演にしなきゃ！", "zh": "好！既然这样，就必须办成一场性感得\n让{$P$}都甘拜下风的公演才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0187_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_01_1045_028ari", "source_sha256": "b9149c8bd383b7e04ebdfd46f45b9560145b0578f7601f192e29ee77223fad14", "ja": "はい、海美ちゃん！\nありさも微力ながらお手伝いさせてもらいますね！", "zh": "好的，海美！\n虽然我能力有限，但亚利沙也会尽微薄之力来帮忙的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0187_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_01_1046_029umi", "source_sha256": "925b4f361c13e24cd51f5d0199c43dab79dc5e3e26d05725ac2544b014e091ec", "ja": "うんっ！　頼りにしてるよ、ありりん！\n琴葉としほりんも、一緒にがんばろうね！", "zh": "嗯！那就拜托你啦，亚里铃！\n琴叶和志保铃也一起加油吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0187_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_01_1047_017kth", "source_sha256": "59933ff8c75695234e84ac2bf1c4795d3cf319983cd3572a2977c9fa975817ab", "ja": "そうだね。{$P$}の狙いどおり……\nううん、狙い以上の公演にしよう！", "zh": "没错。就按{$P$}的目标……  \n不，要办成超出目标的公演！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0187_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_01_1048_033sih", "source_sha256": "b3f1c60f562793aa718caee5187f6a51fbbe526aab63f80f518f7e0291413c3f", "ja": "狙い以上……。そうですね。私も、\nみなさんの足を引っ張らないようにがんばります。", "zh": "超出预期……是啊。我也会努力，不给大家拖后腿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0187_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_01_1049_p", "source_sha256": "a5c09adbb335f023dc65f99043cc37c4f874739672c84d175aeba715b4baf19e", "ja": "（ユニットの団結は、既にバッチリだな！　なんだか\n変なスイッチを押してしまった気もするけど……）", "zh": "（组合已经团结得相当不错了！虽然总觉得自己好像按下了什么奇怪的开关……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0187_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_01_1050_p", "source_sha256": "e7752371cd913dccaf72182604674e3842fab9874ac03c770783fce54f6f355a", "ja": "（とにかく、しばらくは口を挟まず見守ろう！）", "zh": "（总之，暂时先别插嘴，静观其变吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
